WEBVTT

00:16.580 --> 00:20.220
<b>Touku o miteru sono manazashi wa</b>

00:20.220 --> 00:23.820
<b>Kokoro no naka no koe o kiiteru</b>

00:23.820 --> 00:27.810
<b>Mada aoi tsuki o dakishimete</b>

00:31.190 --> 00:34.730
<b>Hashiri-tsuzukeru
kimi no tsuyosa ga</b>

00:34.730 --> 00:38.400
<b>Mata atarashii tobira o hiraku</b>

00:38.400 --> 00:42.360
<b>Sugu akeru yoru o terashidase</b>

00:45.740 --> 00:52.950
<b>Tatoe hitori de mo kimi
no koto shinjite itai</b>

00:52.950 --> 01:00.260
<b>Sonna shunkan ni kono
sekai wa ugokidasu</b>

01:00.260 --> 01:03.890
<b>Nani o mitsukete yukou</b>

01:03.890 --> 01:07.500
<b>Kokoro o hakidashite</b>

01:07.500 --> 01:14.770
<b>Mata koko de aeru yo
sore ga shinjitsu nara</b>

01:14.770 --> 01:18.410
<b>Nani o mitsumete iyou</b>

01:18.410 --> 01:25.150
<b>Kono te o sashidashite
tsukanda genjitsu o</b>

01:25.150 --> 01:28.910
<b>Let it go, Shinjiyou</b>

01:42.000 --> 01:45.160
<b>This isn't about fighting or anything.</b>

01:46.170 --> 01:48.230
<b>He's having fun!</b>

01:50.510 --> 01:52.440
<b>Sanzo...</b>

01:52.440 --> 01:55.310
<b>What would you think...</b>

02:00.580 --> 02:02.520
<b>...if you saw Goku like this?</b>

02:03.690 --> 02:05.120
<b>Damn it!</b>

02:05.750 --> 02:07.220
<b>Kou!</b>

02:07.560 --> 02:09.350
<b>Kou!</b>

02:32.980 --> 02:34.450
<b>I don't stand a chance.</b>

02:36.590 --> 02:39.580
<b>There's no way I'd stand a chance
against a monster like this!</b>

02:44.360 --> 02:45.790
<b>This is no joke.</b>

02:46.360 --> 02:48.830
<b>He defeated Dokugakuji
with just one blow.</b>

02:49.700 --> 02:51.690
<b>This isn't funny.</b>

02:53.540 --> 02:57.160
<b>No, what's not funny...</b>

02:59.070 --> 03:01.240
<b>...is yet to come.</b>

03:01.240 --> 03:03.610
<b>Stop that thing?</b>

03:04.980 --> 03:06.720
<b>You sure ask for the impossible.</b>

03:06.720 --> 03:08.180
<b>You know that, Goku?</b>

03:10.890 --> 03:13.720
<b>All right, come and get me, monkey.</b>

03:31.040 --> 03:32.510
<b>Damn, again?!</b>

03:36.340 --> 03:38.940
<b>Quit putting your teeth marks on it!</b>

03:52.990 --> 03:56.160
<b>Quit looking like you're
having so much fun.</b>

04:17.850 --> 04:20.690
<b>That should be good enough, Goku.</b>

04:22.960 --> 04:26.560
<b>It's already been at least thirty
minutes since Sanzo was stabbed.</b>

04:26.560 --> 04:28.830
<b>It's getting to the point
where time is critical.</b>

04:28.830 --> 04:31.170
<b>If you continue to berserk,</b>

04:31.170 --> 04:33.760
<b>YOU'RE the one who'll
end up being hurt!</b>

04:36.470 --> 04:39.670
<b>Words aren't even getting
through to him now.</b>

04:43.780 --> 04:45.250
<b>Goku!</b>

04:45.780 --> 04:47.320
<b>I might be able to read his moves,</b>

04:47.320 --> 04:49.080
<b>but it's all I can do
just to dodge them!</b>

04:57.190 --> 04:59.720
<b>Gojyo, get Goku's coronet! Hurry!</b>

05:00.700 --> 05:02.160
<b>Damn it...</b>

05:12.810 --> 05:14.270
<b>Gojyo...</b>

05:16.510 --> 05:18.310
<b>Who are we kidding?</b>

05:18.310 --> 05:22.580
<b>There's no way we can stop that thing.</b>

05:23.250 --> 05:29.750
<b>What the heck is he? He's no demon.
He's a monster!</b>

05:30.860 --> 05:35.190
<b>Yes, but it's Goku.</b>

05:48.540 --> 05:50.010
<b>Goku...</b>

06:09.000 --> 06:13.300
<b>Get it together, you stupid monkey.</b>

06:14.400 --> 06:15.870
<b>Sanzo!</b>

06:16.640 --> 06:20.570
<b>It can't be. He shouldn't be able
to get up in his current state!</b>

06:21.340 --> 06:25.900
<b>The more he moves, the more
the poison will spread!</b>

06:26.880 --> 06:30.720
<b>Come on, try killing me.</b>

06:35.790 --> 06:37.260
<b>Sanzo...</b>

06:38.130 --> 06:39.590
<b>Are you serious?</b>

06:41.800 --> 06:43.260
<b>Come on.</b>

07:12.130 --> 07:16.390
<b>Sorry, but I've got no bullets
to waste on you.</b>

08:20.960 --> 08:22.660
<b>He's back to normal.</b>

08:30.410 --> 08:31.870
<b>Stupid monkey...</b>

08:46.320 --> 08:48.480
<b>Sanzo... Goku...</b>

08:51.030 --> 08:52.750
<b>Kou! Hey, Kou!</b>

08:53.900 --> 08:55.360
<b>Damn it!</b>

08:56.900 --> 08:58.370
<b>Is he all right?</b>

08:59.570 --> 09:03.270
<b>Personally, I'd rather not, but
I'm going to withdraw for now.</b>

09:03.270 --> 09:06.210
<b>Let's both regroup.</b>

09:06.210 --> 09:08.410
<b>I know it's pointless
to say this to you,</b>

09:08.410 --> 09:12.080
<b>but this isn't a fight. It's
taking each other down.</b>

09:12.080 --> 09:16.450
<b>I know it's something he decided
on, and we picked this fight,</b>

09:16.450 --> 09:17.920
<b>so I'll admit that we lost.</b>

09:20.190 --> 09:23.350
<b>But I'll never forgive you guys.</b>

09:26.860 --> 09:29.490
<b>No, I don't suppose so.</b>

09:41.440 --> 09:44.640
<b>Hakuryu, I see you've
recovered a little.</b>

09:45.850 --> 09:49.180
<b>I'm sure it'll be hard, but please
transform into the car.</b>

09:51.450 --> 09:55.480
<b>I'm sorry. We're always
so dependent on you.</b>

09:59.160 --> 10:00.630
<b>I'm counting on you, dragon.</b>

10:01.960 --> 10:04.400
<b>Kou... Pitiful, isn't it?</b>

10:05.000 --> 10:06.530
<b>On top of our loss,</b>

10:06.530 --> 10:09.530
<b>I've broken your promise
about the flying dragon.</b>

10:12.340 --> 10:13.810
<b>But right now...</b>

10:14.910 --> 10:16.380
<b>It's the only choice I've got.</b>

10:17.080 --> 10:20.340
<b>You can complain to me
about it all you want later.</b>

10:24.190 --> 10:26.020
<b>Hakuryu, please hang in there.</b>

10:27.120 --> 10:30.580
<b>Sanzo's body won't last at this rate.</b>

10:31.990 --> 10:34.760
<b>We have to get back to the
village before the sun sets.</b>

10:41.070 --> 10:42.800
<b>My vision's getting blurry.</b>

10:42.800 --> 10:45.140
<b>He might've gotten to some
of my internal organs.</b>

10:46.040 --> 10:49.480
<b>I don't know if I'll last until
we get to the village.</b>

11:00.490 --> 11:02.620
<b>Gojyo?</b>

11:02.620 --> 11:05.290
<b>Let me drive, Hakkai.</b>

11:06.030 --> 11:07.590
<b>Please stay lying down.</b>

11:08.160 --> 11:11.760
<b>You took damage to your ribs
when you collided with me.</b>

11:12.730 --> 11:14.200
<b>Never mind that!</b>

11:15.570 --> 11:17.040
<b>Trade places.</b>

11:17.740 --> 11:19.410
<b>Gojyo...</b>

11:19.410 --> 11:21.930
<b>Don't do reckless things
just to act cool.</b>

11:23.980 --> 11:25.540
<b>It makes me look pitiful.</b>

11:30.080 --> 11:31.550
<b>Thank you.</b>

11:35.960 --> 11:37.990
<b>So what if you're a Sanzo?!</b>

11:37.990 --> 11:42.730
<b>In the end, you're just humans
who chant sutras!</b>

11:42.730 --> 11:44.200
<b>Maybe so.</b>

11:48.570 --> 11:51.110
<b>What're you doing, Sanzo?!</b>

11:51.110 --> 11:54.470
<b>It isn't like you to be so brutal.</b>

11:55.240 --> 11:58.340
<b>So what IS like me?!</b>

11:59.610 --> 12:02.520
<b>Hit me. Why don't you call
me a stupid monkey</b>

12:02.520 --> 12:04.250
<b>and hit me with your paper fan?</b>

12:04.250 --> 12:06.690
<b>That's the Sanzo I know.</b>

12:07.520 --> 12:11.320
<b>Be strong. Be strong, Genjo Sanzo.</b>

12:24.640 --> 12:27.510
<b>I'm not strong.</b>

12:28.310 --> 12:29.780
<b>We know that.</b>

12:30.750 --> 12:35.710
<b>But at the very least, you're
not weak, are you?</b>

12:36.950 --> 12:38.920
<b>How do you feel upon
your awakening?</b>

12:40.720 --> 12:42.190
<b>I feel like shit.</b>

12:45.060 --> 12:48.290
<b>You were in an unconscious
stupor for three whole days.</b>

12:48.960 --> 12:50.830
<b>You're well enough if
you have the energy</b>

12:50.830 --> 12:52.630
<b>to curse the minute you're awake.</b>

12:55.900 --> 12:58.470
<b>So it's been three days?</b>

12:58.470 --> 13:02.380
<b>After the lethal dose of poison
and moving around that much,</b>

13:02.380 --> 13:05.110
<b>it's a miracle you've regained
consciousness in three days.</b>

13:05.680 --> 13:09.310
<b>If it'd been a little later, you
probably wouldn't have lived.</b>

13:13.290 --> 13:18.160
<b>In truth, we don't even remember
how we got back to the village.</b>

13:18.160 --> 13:22.500
<b>If we hadn't been fortunate
enough to be found by that boy,</b>

13:22.500 --> 13:26.020
<b>we might've all become
dried-out corpses out there.</b>

13:27.440 --> 13:29.530
<b>What happened to Kougaiji?</b>

13:30.510 --> 13:33.770
<b>Dokugakuji carried him away.</b>

13:34.340 --> 13:37.280
<b>Though he holds an unfair
grudge against us now.</b>

13:37.910 --> 13:39.470
<b>But I'll never forgive you guys.</b>

13:40.280 --> 13:43.010
<b>I can't say I blame him though.</b>

13:45.320 --> 13:46.790
<b>I see.</b>

13:48.790 --> 13:52.780
<b>If it's Goku, he's in the room
next door with Gojyo.</b>

13:55.060 --> 13:57.600
<b>What? Was I wrong?</b>

13:57.600 --> 13:59.070
<b>Who gives a damn about that idiot?</b>

14:00.840 --> 14:05.670
<b>You were the one who told me once</b>

14:05.670 --> 14:08.400
<b>that you have no need of excess
baggage, weren't you?</b>

14:10.750 --> 14:13.310
<b>So, I'm the idiot then.</b>

14:13.310 --> 14:17.550
<b>If you're aware of that, then
please stay quiet for a while,</b>

14:17.550 --> 14:18.920
<b>since you're a handful.</b>

14:18.920 --> 14:22.180
<b>You sure your personality hasn't
taken a turn for the worse?</b>

14:23.160 --> 14:25.730
<b>No, I'm sorry.</b>

14:25.730 --> 14:27.320
<b>I'm just lashing out a little.</b>

14:30.430 --> 14:33.130
<b>Gojyo and I weren't able
to do anything.</b>

14:33.900 --> 14:36.170
<b>Faced with Goku in berserk mode,</b>

14:36.170 --> 14:39.260
<b>I learned what terror was before
his awesome power.</b>

14:40.040 --> 14:43.980
<b>He asked me to stop him. Me!</b>

14:45.410 --> 14:47.480
<b>But I wasn't able to do it.</b>

14:47.480 --> 14:49.680
<b>I can't help but feel angry
with myself for it.</b>

14:50.250 --> 14:57.520
<b>All the more so because the results
have hurt Goku even more.</b>

14:59.060 --> 15:01.260
<b>That hurts, you idiot!</b>

15:01.260 --> 15:03.930
<b>Can't you wrap it more gently?!</b>

15:03.930 --> 15:07.170
<b>Shut up! This is nothing!
Just grin and bear it!</b>

15:07.170 --> 15:08.670
<b>If you were going to
complain this much,</b>

15:08.670 --> 15:10.910
<b>you should've just got
Hakkai to do it!</b>

15:10.910 --> 15:14.140
<b>You gave me these injuries, so
you take responsibility for them,</b>

15:14.140 --> 15:15.680
<b>you stupid monkey!</b>

15:15.680 --> 15:20.280
<b>What's the big deal? It wasn't
that serious anyway.</b>

15:20.280 --> 15:25.150
<b>You broke three of my ribs, and
you call that not serious?</b>

15:25.150 --> 15:25.950
<b>Well?</b>

15:25.950 --> 15:29.460
<b>I SAID I was sorry!</b>

15:29.460 --> 15:31.930
<b>You could be a little
more repentant!</b>

15:31.930 --> 15:33.830
<b>After that rampage you went on,</b>

15:33.830 --> 15:36.590
<b>you took that nice long
nap all by yourself.</b>

15:38.100 --> 15:39.570
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

15:40.900 --> 15:42.770
<b>I really am sorry.</b>

15:49.780 --> 15:52.370
<b>You moron, don't take it so seriously.</b>

15:54.250 --> 15:57.250
<b>The course of action you
took wasn't wrong.</b>

15:57.250 --> 15:59.490
<b>At the very least,</b>

15:59.490 --> 16:03.250
<b>we probably couldn't have defeated
them if you hadn't done it.</b>

16:04.730 --> 16:07.960
<b>It turned out okay in the end.</b>

16:07.960 --> 16:09.430
<b>Right?</b>

16:12.030 --> 16:13.930
<b>But I...</b>

16:13.930 --> 16:17.030
<b>I don't have any real memories,
but I remember...</b>

16:18.110 --> 16:22.280
<b>My hands were seriously
out to kill people.</b>

16:22.280 --> 16:24.040
<b>And it wasn't just Kougaiji!</b>

16:25.010 --> 16:28.280
<b>You and Hakkai, and even Sanzo.</b>

16:29.020 --> 16:31.540
<b>That's why, I... I...</b>

16:34.920 --> 16:36.790
<b>What'd you do that for, Gojyo?!</b>

16:36.790 --> 16:38.930
<b>What do you take me for?</b>

16:38.930 --> 16:41.420
<b>I'm not so soft that I'd
be killed by you!</b>

16:42.160 --> 16:46.600
<b>And like hell I'd let you
apologize after killing me.</b>

16:46.600 --> 16:49.690
<b>Take a good look. Am I dead?</b>

16:51.840 --> 16:54.740
<b>You couldn't kill me, right?
So take that!</b>

16:56.110 --> 16:57.950
<b>Besides, I've already
decided that when I die,</b>

16:57.950 --> 17:00.680
<b>it's going to be with
a beautiful woman.</b>

17:00.680 --> 17:03.310
<b>I'm not gonna let a
moron like you kill me!</b>

17:04.150 --> 17:06.920
<b>That hurt, you pervy water sprite!</b>

17:06.920 --> 17:10.260
<b>Goodness, please be more quiet.</b>

17:10.260 --> 17:12.230
<b>We could hear you next door.</b>

17:13.290 --> 17:16.230
<b>Sanzo's awake now.</b>

17:17.000 --> 17:20.690
<b>Well, then maybe I'll go
look in on his stinking face.</b>

17:21.840 --> 17:23.800
<b>Don't run, monkey.</b>

17:23.800 --> 17:25.840
<b>No! Let go!</b>

17:25.840 --> 17:29.440
<b>I bet Sanzo's really, super mad!</b>

17:29.440 --> 17:31.810
<b>How the heck am I
supposed to face him?!</b>

17:32.450 --> 17:35.350
<b>Sheesh, you were pacing around,</b>

17:35.350 --> 17:37.590
<b>more worried than any
of us just a minute ago!</b>

17:37.590 --> 17:38.650
<b>But...</b>

17:38.650 --> 17:43.960
<b>Sanzo isn't such an unforgiving
person as that.</b>

17:43.960 --> 17:45.060
<b>Probably...</b>

17:45.060 --> 17:46.690
<b>But...</b>

17:46.690 --> 17:51.130
<b>So you're just going to leave
things like this, Goku?</b>

17:53.230 --> 17:54.700
<b>Well...</b>

17:58.170 --> 17:59.870
<b>Sa... Sanzo...</b>

18:01.280 --> 18:04.180
<b>So, here's your owner.</b>

18:04.180 --> 18:08.510
<b>I believe I told him to stay
quiet just a moment ago.</b>

18:10.580 --> 18:12.050
<b>Goku...</b>

18:12.820 --> 18:14.590
<b>What?</b>

18:14.590 --> 18:18.080
<b>I'm thirsty. Give me a can of beer.</b>

18:21.900 --> 18:23.360
<b>Here.</b>

18:32.370 --> 18:33.840
<b>Sa...</b>

18:38.150 --> 18:39.750
<b>You stupid monkey!</b>

18:39.750 --> 18:40.920
<b>Ouch!</b>

18:40.920 --> 18:43.520
<b>Grow out of being such
an idiot already!</b>

18:43.520 --> 18:45.720
<b>I'm always telling you not to
run headlong into situations</b>

18:45.720 --> 18:48.120
<b>without thinking about the
consequences, you stupid moron!</b>

18:48.960 --> 18:53.960
<b>Hakkai, he's not forgiving at all!</b>

18:53.960 --> 18:57.060
<b>That's why I qualified it with
a "probably," remember?</b>

19:04.070 --> 19:05.540
<b>Man...</b>

19:08.440 --> 19:09.970
<b>What're you laughing about?</b>

19:10.740 --> 19:12.210
<b>I ain't laughing.</b>

19:14.280 --> 19:15.710
<b>Creepy bastard.</b>

19:16.480 --> 19:18.970
<b>He's certainly coaxed
him out of his shell.</b>

19:19.620 --> 19:21.550
<b>He's so twisted.</b>

19:22.320 --> 19:24.810
<b>Master Sanzo's such a shy boy.</b>

19:27.160 --> 19:30.630
<b>I brought fresh bandages for you.</b>

19:30.630 --> 19:34.170
<b>You bastard! You're really gonna
hit someone with that someday!</b>

19:34.170 --> 19:36.800
<b>It won't hit you if you've been good.</b>

19:36.800 --> 19:38.240
<b>You're the last person I
want to hear that from,</b>

19:38.240 --> 19:39.070
<b>Thank you very much.</b>

19:39.070 --> 19:40.910
<b>You stinking apocalyptic monk!</b>

19:40.910 --> 19:44.010
<b>Damn it, you're in the way!
Move it, monkey!</b>

19:44.010 --> 19:46.280
<b>Quit calling me a monkey,
red roach water sprite!</b>

19:46.280 --> 19:51.490
<b>Red roach?! When the hell did
you make up a term like that?!</b>

19:51.490 --> 19:52.690
<b>You bastard!</b>

19:52.690 --> 19:55.660
<b>I called you a roach cuz
you're a roach!</b>

19:55.660 --> 19:58.130
<b>What the heck are these
antennas for then?! Well?!</b>

19:58.130 --> 20:01.400
<b>Owowowow! Don't pull
them, you stupid monkey!</b>

20:01.400 --> 20:04.530
<b>Shut up already, you stupid duo!</b>

20:04.530 --> 20:06.500
<b>They're so rowdy.</b>

20:06.500 --> 20:10.160
<b>Yes, I'm sorry about that.
Please don't mind them.</b>

20:12.610 --> 20:14.230
<b>This is normal for them.</b>

20:16.010 --> 20:17.670
<b>We're here, Kou.</b>

20:21.180 --> 20:23.710
<b>Those wounds will be no
problem for Yaone.</b>

20:28.620 --> 20:30.210
<b>Welcome back.</b>

20:44.170 --> 20:50.580
<b>Sou hito ga yosasou
na kao de yatte kuru</b>

20:50.580 --> 20:55.950
<b>Totsuzen na higeki mo
utagau koto wa naku</b>

20:55.950 --> 21:01.420
<b>Nagekigoto sezu damatta mama de</b>

21:01.420 --> 21:04.830
<b>Ue o miagerunda</b>

21:04.830 --> 21:10.630
<b>Donna arifureta shiin
mo enji-tsuzukeru</b>

21:10.630 --> 21:16.070
<b>Yume toka kibou toka iu mae ni sa</b>

21:16.070 --> 21:21.380
<b>Kitto dare ni totte
mo onaji koto darou</b>

21:21.380 --> 21:25.330
<b>You must fight against yourself</b>

21:32.320 --> 21:35.990
<b>The sun sets and a new day comes</b>

21:35.990 --> 21:37.930
<b>Repeating is one change</b>

21:37.930 --> 21:42.060
<b>Don't avert eyes from differences</b>

21:42.060 --> 21:46.200
<b>Your nerve and soul to the limit</b>

21:46.200 --> 21:48.870
<b>Go forward now</b>

21:48.870 --> 21:53.910
<b>Haritsumeta puresshaa
tonariawase de</b>

21:53.910 --> 21:59.350
<b>Dare yori mo daitan futeki ni warau</b>

21:59.350 --> 22:04.750
<b>Kitto dare ni totte
mo onaji koto darou</b>

22:04.750 --> 22:08.810
<b>You must fight against yourself</b>
